  "description": "DRIT.Spreadsheet is a pure-managed, cross-platform .NET library for creating, reading, and manipulating spreadsheet documents (XLSX, XLS, XLSB, CSV, TSV). It offers comprehensive spreadsheet capabilities including a formula calculation engine, charts, pivot tables, tables, conditional formatting, data validation, digital signatures (PKCS#12, XAdES-BES), AES-256 encryption, form controls, VBA macros, and PDF export — built on a clean-room implementation with minimal NuGet dependencies.",
